<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<svg version="1.1" id="Layer_1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0px" y="0px"
	 width="320px" height="160px" viewBox="0 0 320 160">
<!-- BLOODMOON engine screen, 320x160, traced by eye from the user's picture. One colour per knob, all line work:
     red = the blood moon (red knob, MOONRISE: the moon rises behind the cathedral)   white = cathedral and stars (white knob, HAUNTING: stars flicker)
     blue = windows and rose window (blue knob, BLOOD: the rose window turns)         green = the two tower bells (green knob, ECLIPSE: how far they swing)
     Groups moon.c moves: moon, rose, bellL, bellR, stars0, stars1, stars2. The cathedral body is filled black so it hides the moon behind it. -->
